### Purchase report with graph year filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31&chart_year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Purchase Report - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Vendor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?vendor=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Product Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?category=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter by PO Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?po_status=approved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter by PO Bill Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?bill_status=billed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Payment Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?payment_status=partially_paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Monthly Chart for 2025
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?page=2&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Export CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/purchase/?export=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/csv